  "description": {
   "en": "Years after a dragon fell in Edo city... The city rebuilt itself alongside the dragon.\nWhen samurai from the Matsumichi domain heard that a cure for the plague existed within the dormant dragon's body, they ventured inside.\nThere, they encountered a man tasked with managing and exploring the dragon...?\n\n(Source: MangaPlus)",
   "ja": "江戸に竜が墜落して幾年――。江戸は、竜とともに復興を遂げた。\n仮死状態の竜の体内に、疫病の治療薬があると聞いた松道藩藩士は、竜の体内に侵入する。\nそこで竜の管理・探索を担う男と出会い――…？"
  },
